Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,Texas ain't
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.56,0:00:00.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,big enough
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.92,0:00:02.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,for two mascots.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.42,0:00:03.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,The Spurs Coyote.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.84,0:00:05.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,The Rockets Bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.28,0:00:06.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,High noon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.08,0:00:07.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,One hoop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.14,0:00:07.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,San Antonio
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.58,0:00:08.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,is 15 and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.42,0:00:09.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,3, first
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.14,0:00:10.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,in the West.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.16,0:00:10.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,Houston is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.56,0:00:11.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,13 and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.08,0:00:12.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,5, right behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.52,0:00:13.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,So the mascots
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.08,0:00:13.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,are settling it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.74,0:00:14.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,the Texas way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.98,0:00:15.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,In this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.30,0:00:16.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,corner: the Coyote.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.76,0:00:17.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,doing this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.18,0:00:18.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,since 1983, Hall
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.74,0:00:20.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,of Fame, 2007,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.42,0:00:20.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,and a real
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.86,0:00:21.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,coyote runs 43
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.98,0:00:23.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,miles an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.12,0:00:23.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,And in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.44,0:00:24.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,this corner: Clutch,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.96,0:00:26.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,since 95, Hall
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.28,0:00:28.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,of Fame, 2006,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.08,0:00:28.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,one year earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.88,0:00:29.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,He made
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.50,0:00:30.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,sure you knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.76,0:00:31.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,7 feet tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.64,0:00:32.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,a real
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.00,0:00:33.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,grizzly runs 40.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.58,0:00:34.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,Clutch's official name
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.24,0:00:35.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,is Houston's number
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.30,0:00:36.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,one fan, Clutch,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.56,0:00:38.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,The Rockets Bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.60,0:00:38.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,By the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.80,0:00:39.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,time he
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.10,0:00:39.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,finished introducing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.74,0:00:40.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,himself, the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.58,0:00:42.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,coyote scored twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.12,0:00:42.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,But there's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.66,0:00:43.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.44,0:00:44.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,In 2005,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.46,0:00:45.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,the coyote became
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.16,0:00:46.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,the first mascot
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.02,0:00:47.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,in NBA history
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.00,0:00:48.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,to get ejected.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.16,0:00:48.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,So the ref
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.82,0:00:49.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,is watching him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.98,0:00:51.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,very closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.50,0:00:52.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,Coyote crosses over.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.58,0:00:53.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,Clutch doesn't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.96,0:00:55.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,Coyote crosses back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.30,0:00:55.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,Clutch still
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.80,0:00:56.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,doesn't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.76,0:00:57.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then Clutch
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.32,0:00:57.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,just sits
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.76,0:00:58.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,on the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.86,0:00:59.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,And here's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.24,0:01:00.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,the twist.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.08,0:01:00.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,There's an
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.28,0:01:01.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,old Houston theory
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.10,0:01:01.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,that Clutch isn't
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.98,0:01:02.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,even a bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.94,0:01:03.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,He's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.08,0:01:03.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,a mashup
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.60,0:01:04.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,of every
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.12,0:01:05.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,endangered species.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.64,0:01:06.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,Turtle shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.62,0:01:07.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,Eagle wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.70,0:01:08.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,Elephant trunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.80,0:01:09.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,Clutch flies
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.36,0:01:09.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,over the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.70,0:01:10.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,barn and dunks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.98,0:01:11.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,Coyote fouls
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.56,0:01:12.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,him mid-air.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.46,0:01:13.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,Whistle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.08,0:01:13.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,Ejected.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.82,0:01:14.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.66,0:01:16.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,21 years later.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.16,0:01:16.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,Spurs fans
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.50,0:01:16.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,say that
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.98,0:01:18.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,wasn't a foul.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.18,0:01:18.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,Rockets fans
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.44,0:01:18.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,say that
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.92,0:01:20.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,wasn't a bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.14,0:01:21.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,Comment who wins!
